OL,3,GNEWSAStately homes warn over 'Halloween
OL,4,Aevent'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn an email to Burton Constable Hall,
OL,7,Fthe company said there had been "some
OL,8,Fconfusion" on its end regarding the
OL,9,Flisting. The BBC has contacted Haunted
OL,10,FHalloween Escape for comment.
